        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "874b292e-e10a-57e0-ad60-9ccbaea340e7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: In Love and War (1987 film)\n- People: James Stockdale, Sybil Stockdale, James Woods, Jane Alexander\n- Roles: United States Navy vice admiral, aviator, prisoner of war\n- Events: Vietnam War\n- Awards: Medal of Honor\n\nFacts:\n- James Bond Stockdale was born on December 23, 1923, and later became a United States Navy vice admiral and aviator.\n- During the Vietnam War, James Stockdale was held as an American prisoner of war for more than seven years.\n- During the Vietnam War, James Stockdale received the Medal of Honor.\n- In Love and War is a 1987 Vietnam War-based thriller-drama television film.\n- In Love and War stars James Woods and Jane Alexander.\n- In Love and War is based on the true story of James Stockdale and Sybil Stockdale.\n- James Bond Stockdale died on July 5, 2005.",
